WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.050
Request user-judged refinement: one draft at a time. Typing plays at 2x speed.

00:06.050 --> 00:08.520
CLIO writes the first candidate. Actual generation plays at 2x speed.

00:08.520 --> 00:12.500
Read Draft 1. Refinement starts with one candidate, rather than independent alternatives.

00:12.500 --> 00:20.800
Enter a comment: use plain language, preserve the figures, and explain the limits of the snapshots.

00:20.800 --> 00:23.800
Click Refine Draft 1. CLIO uses this draft and your feedback to write the revision.

00:23.800 --> 00:29.800
Draft 2 says Refined from Draft 1. Check its clearer wording and the added limit on journey inference.

00:29.800 --> 00:35.160
Leave the comment empty and click Pick Draft 2 to accept the revised introduction.
